# Template for .env.development / .env.production — real values live in AWS
# Secrets Manager (maatramtrust/dev/app, maatramtrust/prod/app; profile
# "maatramtrust", region ap-south-1). To restore a lost env file:
#   aws secretsmanager get-secret-value --profile maatramtrust \
#     --secret-id maatramtrust/<stage>/app --query SecretString --output text \
#     | jq -r 'to_entries[] | "\(.key)=\(.value)"' > .env.<environment>
# Alternatively set MAATRAM_SECRETS_STAGE=dev|prod to load them at boot
# (see secrets-env.ts) instead of using env files at all.

# Auth.js / NextAuth
AUTH_SECRET=
AUTH_GOOGLE_ID=
AUTH_GOOGLE_SECRET=

# MongoDB
MONGODB_URI=
# Optional — defaults to the database named in MONGODB_URI
# MONGODB_DB=

# Razorpay
RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=
RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=
RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

# Cloudinary (unsigned uploads in browser; server SDK for deletes)
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLOUDINARY_UPLOAD_PRESET=
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLOUDINARY_FOLDER=
CLOUDINARY_API_KEY=
CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET=

# AWS SES email
AWS_REGION=
# Optional — AWS_REGION takes precedence
# SES_REGION=
SES_FROM_EMAIL=

# Admin access
ADMIN_EMAIL=
ADMIN_EMAILS=
